# Optional. AnyStream reads the public iptv-org JSON from
# https://iptv-org.github.io/api by default. Point this at a self-hosted mirror
# (same six *.json files) if you want to cache the dataset yourself.
# Copy this file to .env.local and uncomment:
# VITE_IPTV_API_BASE=https://my-mirror.example.com/api
